# Legacy course URLs (?id=N) -> static per-course pages
# /course-detail is served normally (Pages serves course-detail.html at the
# clean path automatically); course-detail.js reads ?id=N client-side and
# forwards straight to the matching static course page's clean URL. A
# missing/unknown id falls back to the course catalogue. Do NOT add a
# blanket redirect for /course-detail here — it would strip the ?id
# before course-detail.js ever runs.

# .html requests are already 308'd to the clean path by Pages itself.
